# Everything except the two things the signer image build actually needs:
# the Dockerfile's own build context (docker/) and the pinned lucid-assay
# checkout (_signer/, created by build-signer-image.yml immediately before
# `docker build` runs). Denylist-by-default rather than allowlist-by-
# omission, so a new file added to this repo later doesn't silently end
# up inside the image's build context without a deliberate exception here.
*

!Dockerfile
!docker
!docker/**
!_signer
!_signer/**
